# Spectre data artifacts (collection outputs, derived datasets, checkpoints).
# Note: data/spectre/derived/routedtransport2d_n3_v1/train_vocab.json was
# tracked before this rule and stays tracked; new derived files need `git add -f`.
data/spectre/raw/
data/spectre/checkpoints/
data/spectre/checkpoints_v2/
data/spectre/checkpoints_v2_evidence/
data/spectre/configs/
data/spectre/derived/

# DD2D vendored-env artifacts (large, derived/input data — keep out of git; the
# vendored env *source* under envs/dd2d/ stays tracked). data/ = raw_v2 dataset
# (~2GB); out_dd2d/ = CLIP caches + PIGINet checkpoints (~4.7GB).
src/alphatamp/approaches/spectre/envs/dd2d/data/
src/alphatamp/approaches/spectre/envs/dd2d/out_dd2d/

# Untracked analysis output from analyze_cluttered_storage.ipynb
