wandb/

# Untracked sibling reference checkout of kinder-baselines & related repos
# (a local "knowledge base"; has its own .git). Kept out of git and excluded
# from repo-wide CI tooling (autoformat/mypy/pylint/pytest) — see run_autoformat.sh,
# [tool.mypy]/[tool.isort]/[tool.pytest] in pyproject.toml, and .pylintrc.
/kb/
